[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_2]
More of Them

[en.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_2_desc]
There are simply too many of them. More ponies than the apple ciders they line up to buy. So let’s do that the other way around. Let them line up to be bought?\nNo I don’t mean sell them as slaves. I mean let them volunteerily sign the papers and join the army.

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_2]
再来一点

[zh.FOCUS_GEN_MILITARY_ARMY_CONSCRIPTION_2_desc]
他们太多了。小马的数量比他们排队购买的苹果酒还要多。所以我们换个方式。让他们排队被购买好不好？\n不，我不是说把他们当奴隶卖。我是说让他们自愿签字加入军队。

